00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
mdEditor — Markdown on Windows

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Open a sample with diagrams and math

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Edit the heading. The preview updates.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Preview the equation with KaTeX

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Edit a Mermaid label. The diagram updates.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Save the Markdown document

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Syntax opens a Markdown reference with examples

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Close the reference and return to editing

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Open the preview in a separate window beside the editor

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Switch to dark mode. The separate preview follows.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Return the preview to the main window

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Choose Save as PDF, then a destination

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:08.000
PDF saved. PDF pages stay white, even in dark mode.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Return to the document

